    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Corry Estates are delighted to welcome No. 20 Strandmill Road to the market. The house is sure to suit those looking for a 3 bedroom end of terrace house with the added benefit of garage space to the side which offers the potential to extend. Upon arrival viewers will be impressed by the bright and spacious living accommodation which comprises of a reception hall, a spacious lounge with feature fireplace, a well proportioned shaker style kitchen / dining area with french doors leading to the landscaped rear garden, completes the ground floor living space. The first floor comprises of 2 double bedrooms and a box bedroom, and a family bathroom. Benefiting from PVC double glazed windows, gas fired radiator central heating, pull down ladder to attic, space to the side and rear which offers the potential to extend subject to P.P. and a beautifully landscaped rear garden. Ideally located within a mature residential development the house is just minutes` walk from Portmarnock`s sandy Beach, local shops, schools, commuter bus links and Portmarnock Dart Station. Viewing comes highly recommended to appreciate this fine family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall\r\n4.45m (14'7\") x 1.77m (5'10\") Laminate flooring. Smart Understairs storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.48m (14'8\") x 3.57m (11'9\") Feature fireplace with cast iron inset, gas fire and timber surround. TV point.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n2.9m (9'6\") x 5.44m (17'10\") Range of shaker style fitted press units. Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. Tiled floor and tiled behind worktop. Double doors to rear garden.\r\n\r\n1st Floor: \r\nLanding\r\n2.53m (8'4\") x 1.97m (6'6\") Pull down ladder to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.9m (9'6\") x 3.37m (11'1\") Built-in wardrobes. Varnished floorboards.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.52m (14'10\") x 3.38m (11'1\") Built-in wardrobe. Varnished floorboards.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.08m (10'1\") x 2.18m (7'2\") Built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.65m (5'5\") x 1.94m (6'4\") Comprising of bath, W.C. and W.H.B. Fully tiled.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nLandscaped rear garden. Driveway parking. Space to the side and rear which offers the potential to extend subject to planning permission.\r\nNot over looked to the rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "PVC Double Glazed Windows\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nSpace To Side With Potential To Extend Subject To P.P.\r\nBeautiful Landscaped Private Rear Garden\r\nIdeally Located Close To Beach And All Local Services And Amenities"
      },
